label "Golden trajectories and snapshot tests diagram"
box session 20 30 120 44 "known-good run"
box golden 170 24 130 56 "golden case|expected path + answer" acc
box build 20 150 120 44 "new build"
box replay 170 150 130 44 "replay same input"
box cmp 330 90 110 56 "comparator|flags differences"
arrow session golden
arrow golden cmp
arrow build replay
arrow replay cmp
note "differences in tool path or answer are flagged"
